      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#lyceum"><hi rend="allcaps">Theatre Royal, Lyceum</hi></placeName><lb/>
               Under the Authority of Lord Chamberlain.<lb/>
               This present <hi rend="allcaps">Saturday, <date when="1811-01-19">January 19, 1811</date></hi>.<lb/>
               Their Majesties Servants will Act the Play of The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_stranger"><hi rend="allcaps">Stranger.</hi></title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>The Stranger,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_ra">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Raymond,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Count Wintersen,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_ray">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Ray,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baron Steinfert,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_waldegrave">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Waldegrave,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mr. Solomon,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ra_we">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wewitzer,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Peter,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_ox">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Oxberry,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Francis,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_pa">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Palmer,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tobias,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_po">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Powell</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Mrs. Haller,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ja_po">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Powell,</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Countess Wintersen,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#su_bo">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Boyce</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Charlotte,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#an_sc">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Scott</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">The Vocal Parts by</hi> <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ma_bl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Bland</hi></persName> and <persName ref="namedentities.xml#miss_l_kelly">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">L. Kelly</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               After which a <hi rend="italic">New Musical Farce</hi>, <hi rend="allcaps">Never Performed,</hi> called<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_bee_hive">The Bee Hive.</title></bibl><lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">Overture</hi> and <hi rend="allcaps">Music</hi> entirely New,<lb/>
               Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ed_ho">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Horn</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head><hi rend="italic">The Characters by</hi></head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ma">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mathews</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#be_wr">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wrench</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#wi_lo">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lovegrove</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_ch">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Chatterley</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_mo">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Mountain</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_kelly">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ch_ti">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Tidswell</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               Boxes and Places to be taken of Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Spring</hi>, at the Box Office in the<lb/>
               Strand Entrances, of whom may also be had <hi rend="allcaps">Private Boxes</hi> Nightly.<lb/>
               Boxes <measure type="currency">6s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. Pit <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <measure type="currency">6d</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. Gallery <measure type="currency">2s</measure>.<lb/>
               Second Price <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Upper Gallery <measure type="currency">1s</measure>. Second Price <measure type="currency">6d</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be opened at <time when="17:30:00">Half past Five</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="18:30:00">half past Six</time>.<lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">Vivant Rex et Regina!-No Money to be returned.</hi></ab> 
         </div>
